{"success":true,"notifications":[{"id":3256,"notification_type":"outage","message":"As part of NASA’s planned Consolidated Ingest and Archive (I\u0026amp;A) system migration, the following data centers will experience temporary interruptions to new data ingestion and availability: PO.DAAC:\u0026nbsp; October 28, 11:00 AM – 8:00 PM ET, ASF DAAC: October 28, 5:00 PM ET – October 29, 5:00 PM ET, GES DISC: October 28, 5:00 PM – October 30, 9:00 AM ET Existing data search and download services are expected to remain operational during these periods. New data ingestion will resume, and newly ingested data will become available, once the migration is complete.We appreciate your patience and understanding.","updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:26:11.141-04:00","created_at":"2026-10-16T14:11:00.189-04:00","starttime":"2026-10-16T14:08:00.000-04:00","endtime":"2026-11-02T14:08:00.000-05:00","applications":["Earthdata Search","Earthdata Search (SIT)","Earthdata Search (UAT)"],"domains":["https://search.earthdata.nasa.gov","https://search.sit.earthdata.nasa.gov","https://search.uat.earthdata.nasa.gov"],"dismissible":true,"critical":false,"path":""},{"id":2083,"notification_type":"message","message":"Testing","updated_at":"2023-08-30T10:18:32.290-04:00","created_at":"2023-08-30T10:18:32.290-04:00","starttime":null,"endtime":null,"applications":["ASDC webRA Subsetter Web App (Dev)"],"domains":["https://dev-subset.larc.nasa.gov"],"dismissible":true,"critical":false,"path":"/mopitt/"},{"id":2415,"notification_type":"alert","message":"We are currently investigating the reasons for visual gaps in the OPERA Dynamic Surface Water Extent (DSWx-HLS) layer. The full archive of data is available at \u003ca href=\"https://search.earthdata.nasa.gov/search/granules?p=C2617126679-POCLOUD\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eEarthdata Search\u003c/a\u003e.  We apologize for the inconvenience.","updated_at":"2026-02-03T16:18:38.322-05:00","created_at":"2024-09-16T09:46:31.480-04:00","starttime":"2024-09-16T09:48:00.